  "description": "Quinn Property Management is delighted to bring to the market this stunning  four bedroom , three bathroom detached home, ideally located outside the peaceful and sought after village of Ruan.\n\nThis beautifully presented property offers spacious and well balanced accommodation throughout. Upon entering, you are welcomed by a bright and inviting entrance hallway that leads to a generously proportioned living room. To the rear of the home, the open- plan kitchen and dining area provides a wonderful space for everyday living, featuring ample natural light and direct access to the private rear garden. \n\nThe property comprises four well appointed bedrooms with one double bedroom located on the ground floor and benefiting from an ensuite bathroom with large corner shower. The main bedroom up stairs features a large ensuite and walk in closest. The remaining two bedrooms are are bright and spacious with a large walkthrough closet separating the spaces. \n\nSet on generous grounds, the home benefits from a large private garden, offering ample outdoor space for relaxation, entertaining guests, or simply enjoying the tranquillity of the surrounding countryside, while remaining within easy reach of Ennis, Shannon, Limerick, and the wider motorway network.\n\n\nViewing of this apartment is highly recommended. * We are requesting expressions of interest by emaiI only. To register your interest in this property, please fill your details in to the Contact Seller box on the right of this ad in order to receive an application form. * Disclaimer: Whilst every care has been taken in the preparation of these particulars, and they are believed to be correct, they are not warranted and intending lessees should satisfy themselves as to the correctness of information given.",
